"status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m014-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"夏桀","kind":"person","person_id":"91n_mvc_uix","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p017","text":"維秦之先，伯翳佐禹；穆公思義，悼豪之旅；以人為殉，詩歌黃鳥；昭襄業帝。作秦本紀第五。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m017-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"伯翳","kind":"person","person_id":"dmg_a1p_rkc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m017-0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"72p_tlt_xy9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m017-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"穆公","kind":"person","person_id":"lbj_xv3_dcb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m017-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"昭襄","kind":"person","person_id":"9b0_pme_uu8","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p041","text":"維禹浚川，九州攸寧；爰及宣防，決瀆通溝。作河渠書第七。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m041-0001","start":1,"end":2,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"72p_tlt_xy9","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p048","text":"王后不絕，舜禹是說；維德休明，苗裔蒙烈。百世享祀，爰周陳杞，楚實滅之。齊田既起，舜何人哉？作陳杞世家第六。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m048-0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ab2_pxs_34r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m048-0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"72p_tlt_xy9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m048-0040","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ab2_pxs_34r","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p053","text":"少康之子，實賓南海，文身斷髮，黿鱓與處，既守封禺，奉禹之祀。句踐困彼，乃用種、蠡。嘉句踐夷蠻能修其德，滅彊吳以尊周室，作越王句踐世家第十一。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m053-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"少康","kind":"person","person_id":"tr0_qvu_64e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m053-0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"72p_tlt_xy9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m053-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"句踐","kind":"person","person_id":"rg0_4a2_21r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m053-0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"種","kind":"person","person_id":"dys_y6g_ndq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m053-0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"蠡","kind":"person","person_id":"vk1_xnw_xz4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m053-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"句踐","kind":"person","person_id":"rg0_4a2_21r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m053-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"句踐","kind":"person","person_id":"rg0_4a2_21r","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-130","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong","source":{"title":"史記／卷130","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷130","permalink":"https://zh.w